"流動比率 = 1.71"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":25.53,"default_fair_val":25.53,"premium_pct":-34.2,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":8.3,"pe_forward":7.3,"pb_trailing":2.2,"pb_forward":2,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":1.5,"fcf_to_ev":16.4,"fcf_to_mcap":16.47,"liab_to_assets":25.4,"cash_to_assets":8.4,"current_ratio":1.71,"roe":26.3,"roa":19.5,"moat":{"ticker":"IAG","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"黃金產業本質上是商品化，IAG 作為一家礦業公司，其產品（黃金）缺乏獨特的品牌溢價能力。儘管公司在開採和生產方面有其聲譽，但這並不能轉化為如同消費品牌那樣的定價權。客戶購買黃金主要基於其商品屬性、市場價格和供應穩定性，而非對 IAG 特定品牌的偏好。因此，在品牌定價權方面，IAG 的護城河極為薄弱，幾乎不存在顯著的差異化優勢，難以在市場上制定高於市場的價格。","comment_en":"The gold industry is inherently commoditized, and as a mining company, IAG's product (gold) lacks unique brand premium capabilities. While the company has a reputation for its mining and production, this does not translate into pricing power akin to consumer brands. Customers purchase gold primarily based on its commodity attributes, market price, and supply stability, rather than a preference for the specific IAG brand. Consequently, IAG's moat in terms of brand pricing power is extremely weak, with virtually no significant differentiation advantage, making it difficult to set prices above the market."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"黃金開採行業的進入壁壘主要來自於礦權的獲取、勘探技術以及嚴格的環保和安全法規。IAG 作為一家成熟的礦業公司，擁有其營運礦區的開採權和相關的許可證，這構成了一定的監管壁壘。然而，這些權利並非專利，其核心技術（如採礦和提煉方法）也非 IAG 獨有，競爭對手可以透過研發或收購獲得類似技術。因此，雖然有監管和礦權的門檻，但其專利或特許的性質非常有限，護城河相對較弱。","comment_en":"Barriers to entry in the gold mining industry primarily stem from acquiring mining rights, exploration technology, and stringent environmental and safety regulations. As an established mining company, IAG possesses mining rights and relevant permits for its operating areas, which constitute a certain regulatory barrier. However, these rights are not patents, and its core technologies (such as mining and refining methods) are not exclusive to IAG; competitors can acquire similar technologies through R&D or acquisitions. Therefore, while there are thresholds related to regulation and mining rights, the nature of its patents or franchises is very limited, resulting in a relatively weak moat."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"對於黃金的購買者而言，轉換成本極低。無論是工業用戶、投資者還是央行，他們購買黃金時，主要關注的是黃金本身的品質、純度、重量以及即時市場價格。他們可以輕易地從任何符合標準的供應商處購買黃金，而無需擔心與特定供應商建立的關係、學習曲線或整合問題。IAG 作為黃金生產商，其客戶並無理由或誘因去承受更高的轉換成本，因此這方面幾乎沒有形成有效的護城河。","comment_en":"For gold purchasers, switching costs are extremely low. Whether they are industrial users, investors, or central banks, when buying gold, their primary focus is on the gold's quality, purity, weight, and the prevailing market price. They can easily purchase gold from any supplier that meets the standards without concerns about relationships established with a specific supplier, learning curves, or integration issues. As a gold producer, IAG's customers have no reason or incentive to bear higher switching costs, thus forming almost no effective moat in this regard."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"網絡效應是指產品或服務的價值隨著用戶數量的增加而增加的現象。在黃金產業中，這幾乎不存在。IAG 作為黃金生產商，其產品的價值並不依賴於有多少人購買或持有黃金，而是黃金本身的稀缺性、供需關係和宏觀經濟因素。沒有任何用戶群體會因為越來越多人購買 IAG 的黃金而覺得更有價值。因此，網絡效應完全不適用於 IAG 的商業模式，護城河為零。","comment_en":"Network effects refer to the phenomenon where the value of a product or service increases with the number of users. In the gold industry, this is virtually non-existent. As a gold producer, the value of IAG's product does not depend on how many people buy or hold gold, but rather on gold's inherent scarcity, supply-demand dynamics, and macroeconomic factors. No user group would find it more valuable because more people are buying IAG's gold. Therefore, network effects are entirely inapplicable to IAG's business model, resulting in a zero moat."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"IAG 作為一家大型黃金生產商，在規模經濟方面具有一定的優勢。大型礦業公司通常能透過規模化採購設備、物料和勞動力，以及更有效地分攤固定成本（如勘探、基礎設施建設、管理費用）來降低單位生產成本。此外，較大的產量也可能使其在與供應商談判時獲得更有利的價格。然而，黃金開採的成本結構受地質條件、礦石品位和地理位置影響極大，規模優勢並非絕對，且易受外部因素影響，故給予中高分。","comment_en":"As a large-scale gold producer, IAG possesses certain advantages in terms of economies of scale. Major mining companies can typically reduce unit production costs by purchasing equipment, materials, and labor at scale, and by more effectively spreading fixed costs (such as exploration, infrastructure development, and administrative expenses). Furthermore, larger production volumes may also grant them more favorable pricing when negotiating with suppliers. However, the cost structure of gold mining is heavily influenced by geological conditions, ore grade, and location, meaning scale advantages are not absolute and are susceptible to external factors. Thus, a moderately high score is assigned."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"IAG 在全球範圍內擁有和營運多個金礦資產，這些資產的地理位置和地質條件是其獨特性的來源。某些礦區可能蘊藏著高品位礦石，或位於政治穩定的地區，或擁有相對容易開採的地質結構，這些都構成了其資產的獨特性。然而，黃金本身是全球交易的商品，優質礦產資源的稀缺性使得競爭對手也在不斷尋找和開發新的礦藏。因此，雖然現有資產具有一定獨特性，但這種優勢並非永久或完全不可複製，護城河為中等。","comment_en":"IAG owns and operates multiple gold mining assets globally, and the geographical locations and geological conditions of these assets are the source of their uniqueness. Certain mining areas may contain high-grade ore, be located in politically stable regions, or have relatively easy-to-mine geological structures, all of which contribute to the uniqueness of its assets. However, gold itself is a globally traded commodity, and the scarcity of high-quality mineral resources means competitors are constantly searching for and developing new deposits. Therefore, while existing assets possess a degree of uniqueness, this advantage is neither permanent nor entirely irreproducible, resulting in a moderate moat."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"IAG 作為一家成熟的礦業公司，其營運效率是其競爭力的關鍵。這包括有效的礦石開採、選礦、冶煉流程，以及對生產成本的嚴格控制。公司透過持續的技術改進、流程優化和精益管理來提升效率。高 ROE (26.3%) 和 ROA (19.5%) 以及滿分的 F-Score (9/9) 都顯示了其卓越的營運管理能力和盈利能力。這種持續的營運效率是構築其護城河的重要組成部分，使其能夠在行業週期中保持相對穩健的表現。","comment_en":"As an established mining company, IAG's operational efficiency is key to its competitiveness. This includes efficient ore extraction, beneficiation, and smelting processes, as well as strict control over production costs. The company enhances efficiency through continuous technological improvements, process optimization, and lean management. High ROE (26.3%) and ROA (19.5%), along with a perfect F-Score (9/9), demonstrate its excellent operational management capabilities and profitability. This sustained operational efficiency is a crucial component of its moat, enabling it to maintain relatively stable performance through industry cycles."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"IAG 在資本配置方面展現出較高的水準，這從其強勁的自由現金流 (FCF TTM: $1,580.7M) 和穩健的資產負債表（現金 $501.8M / 負債 $539.2M）可見一斑。公司能夠有效地將現金用於債務償還、股息發放、股票回購以及對有前景的礦產項目進行再投資。有效的資本配置不僅能提升股東回報，還能確保公司在行業波動中保持財務韌性，並為未來的增長機會奠定基礎。這顯示了管理層的長遠眼光和審慎的決策能力。","comment_en":"IAG demonstrates a high level of capital allocation, evident from its strong Free Cash Flow (FCF TTM: $1,580.7M) and robust balance sheet (Cash $501.8M / Debt $539.2M). The company effectively utilizes cash for debt repayment, dividend distribution, share buybacks, and reinvestment in promising mining projects. Effective capital allocation not only enhances shareholder returns but also ensures financial resilience amidst industry fluctuations and lays the groundwork for future growth opportunities, reflecting management's long-term vision and prudent decision-making."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"由於黃金的商品屬性，IAG 的客戶（主要是批發商、金融機構或工業用戶）的忠誠度不高，轉換成本低。客戶購買黃金時，更看重價格、品質和供應的即時性，而非與特定供應商的長期關係。IAG 難以透過建立客戶忠誠度來形成顯著的護城河。其業務的成功更多依賴於其開採能力、生產成本控制和市場價格，而非客戶的重複購買意願或推薦。因此，客戶保留方面護城河非常薄弱。","comment_en":"Due to the commodity nature of gold, IAG's customers (primarily wholesalers, financial institutions, or industrial users) exhibit low loyalty, and switching costs are minimal. When purchasing gold, customers prioritize price, quality, and immediate availability over long-term relationships with specific suppliers. It is difficult for IAG to build significant customer retention to form a moat. The success of its business relies more on its mining capabilities, production cost control, and market prices, rather than customer repeat purchase intent or referrals. Therefore, the moat in customer retention is very weak."},"m10_durability":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"黃金作為一種貴金屬，其長期價值儲存和對沖通脹的屬性賦予了 IAG 業務一定的持久性。只要人類社會對黃金的需求（無論是作為投資、工業用途還是央行儲備）持續存在，黃金開採行業就有其生存空間。然而，黃金價格的波動性很大，受宏觀經濟、貨幣政策和地緣政治等多重因素影響。此外，礦產資源的枯竭和新礦發現的不確定性也對業務的長期可持續性構成挑戰。因此，其業務的持久性是存在的，但並非沒有風險和不確定性。","comment_en":"Gold, as a precious metal, possesses inherent durability due to its long-term store of value and inflation-hedging properties, which lends a certain persistence to IAG's business. As long as there is demand for gold in human society (whether for investment, industrial use, or central bank reserves), the gold mining industry will have a place. However, gold prices are highly volatile, influenced by multiple factors including macroeconomic conditions, monetary policy, and geopolitics. Furthermore, the depletion of mineral resources and the uncertainty of new mine discoveries pose challenges to the long-term sustainability of the business. Therefore, while durability exists, it is not without risks and uncertainties."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"IAG 作為一家大型黃金生產商，其護城河主要體現在規模經濟帶來的成本優勢（M5）、卓越的營運效率（M7）以及審慎的資本配置能力（M8）。這些因素使其能夠在波動的商品市場中保持相對穩健的盈利能力。然而，黃金的商品屬性導致其在品牌定價權（M1）、客戶轉換成本（M3）和網絡效應（M4）方面幾乎沒有護城河。其獨特的礦產資產（M6）和業務的持久性（M10）提供了一定的保護，但易受市場波動和資源枯竭影響。總體而言，IAG 的護城河屬於中等偏上，但其商品屬性限制了其成為頂級特許經營權的潛力。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"As a large gold producer, IAG's moat is primarily reflected in the cost advantages derived from economies of scale (M5), excellent operational efficiency (M7), and prudent capital allocation capabilities (M8). These factors enable it to maintain relatively stable profitability in the volatile commodity market. However, the commodity nature of gold means it possesses virtually no moat in brand pricing power (M1), customer switching costs (M3), and network effects (M4). Its unique mineral assets (M6) and business durability (M10) offer some protection, but are susceptible to market volatility and resource depletion. Overall, IAG's moat is considered moderately strong, but its commodity nature limits its potential to be a top-tier franchise.","evidenceHash":"7a61648a81ff100f8dd88d617062600a073ce2a3ae014707d3ae4089374b8e94","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":9,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"75c0444593f28d93991e9eeb08b0f21011a71e0ce77e1fe179fba1f1717d092b"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"75c0444593f28d93991e9eeb08b0f21011a71e0ce77e1fe179fba1f1717d092b"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/IAG.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/IAG.png","website":"https://www.iamgold.com","ceo":"Renaud Adams","full_time_employees":"3741","description":"IAMGOLD Corp. engages in the exploration, development and production of gold and mineral resource properties. It owns and operates the Westwood mine in Quebec and the Cote Gold project, a development project located in Ontario. The firm also operates the Rosebel mine in Suriname, the Essakane mine in Burkina Faso, the Saramacca project, an exploration project located in Suriname, the Boto project, an exploration project located in Senegal. The company was founded by William D. Pugliese, Mark I. Nathanson, and Larry E. Phillips on March 27, 1990 and is headquartered in Toronto, Canada.","description_en":"IAMGOLD Corp. engages in the exploration, development and production of gold and mineral resource properties. It owns and operates the Westwood mine in Quebec and the Cote Gold project, a development project located in Ontario. The firm also operates the Rosebel mine in Suriname, the Essakane mine in Burkina Faso, the Saramacca project, an exploration project located in Suriname, the Boto project, an exploration project located in Senegal. The company was founded by William D. Pugliese, Mark I. Nathanson, and Larry E. Phillips on March 27, 1990 and is headquartered in Toronto, Canada.","description_zh":"Iamgold Corporation（美股代碼：IAG）為 Basic Materials 領域之重要企業，專注於 Gold 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"150 King Street West","city":"Toronto","state":"ON","zip":"M5H 1J9","country":"CA","phone":"416 360 4710","full_address":"150 King Street West, Toronto, ON M5H 1J9, CA","range_52w":"10.87-24.87","year_high":24.87,"year_low":10.87,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":10.87,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-02-27","name":"SMITH DAVID STEWART","title":"director","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":15000,"price":32.9,"total_val":0.49},{"date":"2026-02-27","name":"SMITH DAVID STEWART","title":"director","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":6000,"price":32.91,"total_val":0.2},{"date":"2026-02-27","name":"SMITH DAVID STEWART","title":"director","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":5000,"price":32.79,"total_val":0.16},{"date":"2026-02-27","name":"SMITH DAVID STEWART","title":"director","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":5000,"price":32.8,"total_val":0.16}],"stock_splits"